	(property "Description" "LCDWIKI ES3C28P 5V supply on a JST PH B2B-PH-K-S header, 2.0mm, for a cable to a USB-C plug in the ES3C28P's USB-C socket. Pin 1 5V: ES3C28P input, VBUS, into its +5 rail through a Schottky diode (D8); with VBUS up the battery socket stays off the rail. Pin 2 GND. From the LCDWIKI schematic."
